    {
      "id": "p0042-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby joins Starmen.Net, an online community for fans of EarthBound, an obscure Japanese RPG known as MOTHER 2 in Japan. There, he finds that other fans have created tools to modify EarthBound to create completely new games. Toby helps improve these tools and uses them to create short games that are more impressive than his RPG Maker creations.",
        "raw": "Toby joins Starmen.Net, an online community for fans of EarthBound, an\nobscure Japanese RPG known as MOTHER 2 in Japan. There, he finds that\nother fans have created tools to modify EarthBound to create completely new\ngames. Toby helps improve these tools and uses them to create short games\nthat are more impressive than his RPG Maker creations.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29184941,
          0.09408571,
          0.88138564,
          0.17924286
