    {
      "id": "p0042-b006",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "How very disappointing ... you missed out on the secret ending because you are one secret ending point shy. Such a shame ... I saw potential. Next time you play the game, talk to all the people in the village before fighting that wretched squirrel-monger. Well, you're not that far in anyway.",
        "raw": "How very disappointing ... you missed out on the secret ending because you are one\nsecret ending point shy. Such a shame ... I saw potential. Next time you play the game,\ntalk to all the people in the village before fighting that wretched squirrel-monger. Well,\nyou're not that far in anyway.",
        "status": "corrected",
