    {
      "id": "p0042-b009",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "MR.ACCIDENT: Do you honestly think so? I created a monster, Map Editor 4, that at first appeared to be delightful and useful. As time wore on, however, people have discovered that my Map Editor is a little bit. .. well, CORRUPTIVE.",
        "raw": "MR.ACCIDENT: Do you honestly think so? I created a monster, Map Editor 4, that at\nfirst appeared to be delightful and useful. As time wore on, however, people have\ndiscovered that my Map Editor is a little bit. .. well, CORRUPTIVE.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.31712787,
          0.79047857,
          0.85516305,
          0.82478571
