    {
      "id": "p0042-b010",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "I love pain and misery. I believe that the only way to be fulfilled is to be with the one you love, and therefore I must cause as much pain and suffering as I can! Anyone that used my <Map Editor> was never seen again ... and yet it consistently received praise from people too lazy to use it. I'll have a lot of fun destroying you foolish buttzors!",
        "raw": "I love pain and misery. I believe that the only way to be fulfilled is to be with the one you\nlove, and therefore I must cause as much pain and suffering as I can! Anyone that used\nmy <Map Editor> was never seen again ... and yet it consistently received praise from\npeople too lazy to use it. I'll have a lot of fun destroying you foolish buttzors!",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.31749334,
          0.83177857,
          0.87504064,
          0.87849286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.31617358,
          0.83106429,
          0.8763604,
          0.87956429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          72,
          73,
          74,
          75
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "我爱痛苦与不幸。我相信，只有和所爱之物在一起，才能得到满足，所以我必须制造尽可能多的痛苦！凡是用过我的〈地图编辑器〉的人，后来都不见了……可那些懒得用它的人，却一直赞不绝口。收拾你们这些蠢货，一定好玩极了！",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
